hadiths[16]{hadithnumber,text}:
"56","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ali bin Hujr, kaha: Haddasana Al-Fazl bin Musa, Abdul Mu'min bin Khalid se, Abdullah bin Buraidah se, Umm-e-Salmah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko sab se mehboob libas qamees tha."
"57","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ziyad bin Ayyub Al-Baghdadi, kaha: Haddasana Abu Tumailah, Abdul Mu'min bin Khalid se, Abdullah bin Buraidah se, apni maa se, Umm-e-Salmah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko sab se mehboob libas jo woh pehnte, qamees tha."
"58","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Al-Hajjaj, kaha: Haddasana Mu'adh bin Hisham, kaha: Mujhe mere walid ne hadith sunayi, Budeel ya'ni Ibn Maisarah Al-Uqaili se, Shahr bin Hawshab se, Asma bint Yazid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke qamees ki aasteen kalai tak hoti thin."
"59","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abu Ammar Al-Husain bin Hurayth, kaha: Haddasana Abu Nu'aim, kaha: Haddasana Zuhayr, Urwah bin Abdullah bin Qushayr se, Mu'awiyah bin Qurrat se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Muzainah ke ek giroh ke sath Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke paas unki bayat karne ke liye aaya, aur unka qamees khula tha, ya unhon ne kaha: unke qamees ka button khula tha. Unhon ne kaha: Toh main ne apna haath unke qamees ke gale mein daala aur main ne angoothi chhooyi."
"60","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abd bin Humayd, kaha: Haddasana Muhammad bin Al-Fazl, kaha: Haddasana Hammam bin Salamah, Habib bin Al-Shahid se, Al-Hasan se, Anas bin Malik se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) tashreef laye aur woh Usamah bin Zaid par tikiye hue the, unke jism par Qitri libas tha jise unhon ne aar paar lipta hua tha, phir unhone unhein namaz parhayi."
"61","[AI-translation] Haddasana Suwaid bin Nasr, qala: haddasana Abdullah bin Al-Mubarak, 'an Sa'id bin Iyas Al-Jurairi, 'an Abi Nadhra, 'an Abi Sa'id Al-Khudri, qala: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab koi naya libaas pehente to isay uske naam se pukarte the, amaama ho ya qameez ya rida. Phir farmate: Aye Allah! Tere liye hamd hai jis tarah tune mujhe ye pehnaaya, main tujh se iske khair aur us kaam ki khair maangta hoon jis ke liye ye banaaya gaya hai, aur tujh se iske shar aur us kaam ke shar ki panah maangta hoon jis ke liye ye banaaya gaya hai. Haddasana Hisham bin Yunus Al-Kufi, qala: haddasana Al-Qasim bin Malik Al-Muzani, 'an Al-Jurairi, 'an Abi Nadhra, 'an Abi Sa'id Al-Khudri, 'an An-Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), misl ohi."
"62","[AI-translation] Haddasana Suwaid bin Nasr, qala: haddasana Abdullah bin Al-Mubarak, 'an Sa'id bin Iyas Al-Jurairi, 'an Abi Nadhra, 'an Abi Sa'id Al-Khudri, qala: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab koi naya libaas pehente to isay uske naam se pukarte the, amaama ho ya qameez ya rida. Phir farmate: Aye Allah! Tere liye hamd hai jis tarah tune mujhe ye pehnaaya, main tujh se iske khair aur us kaam ki khair maangta hoon jis ke liye ye banaaya gaya hai, aur tujh se iske shar aur us kaam ke shar ki panah maangta hoon jis ke liye ye banaaya gaya hai. Haddasana Hisham bin Yunus Al-Kufi, qala: haddasana Al-Qasim bin Malik Al-Muzani, 'an Al-Jurairi, 'an Abi Nadhra, 'an Abi Sa'id Al-Khudri, 'an An-Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), misl ohi."
"63","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Bashaar, qala: haddasana Mu'adh bin Hisham, qala: haddathani abi, 'an Qatada, 'an Anas bin Malik, qala: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko pahanne hoke sab se mehboob libaas Hibrah tha."
"64","[AI-translation] Haddasana Mahmood bin Ghaylan, qala: haddasana Abdur-Razzaq, qala: haddasana Sufyan, 'an Awn bin Abi Juhayfa, 'an abihi, qala: Maine Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha, aur un par surkh jora tha, goya main unki pindliyon ki chamak dekh raha hoon."
"65","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ali bin Khashram, qala: haddasana 'Isa bin Yunus, 'an Isra'il, 'an Abi Ishaq, 'an Al-Bara' bin 'Azib, qala: Maine Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se badh kar kisi insaan ko surkh jore mein behtar nahi dekha, unki jumma kandho ke qareeb tak pahunchti thi."
"66","[AI-translation] Hamay Muhammad bin Bashar ne riwayat ki, kahaa: Hamay Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi ne riwayat ki, kahaa: Hamay Ubaidullah bin Iyaad ne riwayat ki, apne waalid se, Abu Rimthah se, kahaa: Maine Nabi sallallahu alayhi wasallam ko dekha, aur un par do sabz chadarein theen."
"67","[AI-translation] Hamay Abd bin Humayd ne riwayat ki, kahaa: Hamay Affaan bin Muslim ne riwayat ki, kahaa: Hamay Abdullah bin Hassaan Anbari ne riwayat ki, apni dadiyon Duhaibah aur Ulaibah se, Qaylah bint Makhramah se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi sallallahu alayhi wasallam ko dekha, aur un par do milaai hui chadaron ke purzay the, jo zafran se rangi hui theen, aur unka zafran jhaad diya gaya tha. Aur is hadees mein lamba qissa hai."
"68","[AI-translation] Hamay Qutaybah bin Sa'eed ne riwayat ki, kahaa: Hamay Bishr bin Mufazzal ne riwayat ki, Abdullah bin Uthman bin Khuthaym se, Sa'eed bin Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas se, kahaa: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wasallam ne farmaya: Tum par sefaid libaas laazim hai, tumhare zinda log pehnein, aur apne murdon ko is mein kafan do, kyunkeh yeh tumhare behtareen libaas mein se hain."
"69","[AI-translation] Hamay Muhammad bin Bashar ne riwayat ki, kahaa: Hamay Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi ne riwayat ki, kahaa: Hamay Sufyaan ne riwayat ki, Habib bin Abi Thaabit se, Maimoon bin Abi Shabeeb se, Samurah bin Jundub se, kahaa: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wasallam ne farmaya: Sefaid libaas pehno, kyunkeh yeh paak-tar aur behtar hai, aur apne murdon ko is mein kafan do."
"70","[AI-translation] Hamay Ahmad bin Mani' ne riwayat ki, Hamay Yahya bin Zakariya bin Abi Zaa'idah ne riwayat ki, kahaa: Hamay mere waalid ne riwayat ki, Mus'ab bin Shaybah se, Safiyyah bint Shaybah se, Aishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wasallam ek subah nikle, aur un par kale baal ki chadar thi."
"71","[AI-translation] Hamay Yusuf bin Eesa ne riwayat ki, kahaa: Hamay Wakee' ne riwayat ki, kahaa: Hamay Yunus bin Abi Ishaaq ne riwayat ki, apne waalid se, Sha'bi se, Urwah bin Mughirah bin Shu'bah se, apne waalid se, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wasallam ne aik Roomi jubbah pehna tha, jiske aasteen tang thay."
